in which different values of #S are equiprobable. To give a sense of scale,
we have α = 0.0852, β = 2.1534, and γ = 1.4085 when b = 100.
   Branches (S, T ) whose approximate upper bounds (via (3.1)) lie below a
threshold are pruned, and surviving sets are recorded for further processing
